            },
            "displayName": "Keith Wong",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Hong_Kong"
          },
          "body": "The server is out of my control and I can't tell whether it is an application \nor system fault.  However, may I suggest if there is a way for programmers to \nconfigure their own list of formats instead of changing the code base.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=keith.wong%40objectvalley.com",
            "name": "keith.wong@objectvalley.com",
            "key": "keith.wong@objectvalley.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Keith Wong",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Hong_Kong"
          },
          "created": "2003-08-22T10:22:08.000+0000",
          "updated": "2003-08-22T10:22:08.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12333749/comment/12380168",
          "id": "12380168",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=becke%40u.washington.edu",
            "name": "becke@u.washington.edu",
            "key": "becke@u.washington.edu",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael Becke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Though I agree the server is certainly behaving in a non-standard way, it is by no means the only \none.  I see no reason not to add this date format to our growing list.  We should probably take a \nlook at this as a configuration option for 2.1/3.0.\n\nKeith, please try the attached patch to make sure this fixes the problem.\n\nMike",
